{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/噼里啪啦大爆炸+","pageid":8619,"revid":21300,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%99%BC%E9%87%8C%E5%95%AA%E5%95%A6%E5%A4%A7%E7%88%86%E7%82%B8%2B&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%99%BC%E9%87%8C%E5%95%AA%E5%95%A6%E5%A4%A7%E7%88%86%E7%82%B8%2B&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%99%BC%E9%87%8C%E5%95%AA%E5%95%A6%E5%A4%A7%E7%88%86%E7%82%B8%2B&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>噼里啪啦大爆炸+</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.99.BC.E9.87.8C.E5.95.AA.E5.95.A6.E5.A4.A7.E7.88.86.E7.82.B8.2B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"噼里啪啦大爆炸+\"><b>噼里啪啦大爆炸+</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 噼里啪啦大爆炸.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d9/sco4ohhuybtkwqc74wy1fwrjn2cuile.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%99%BC%E9%87%8C%E5%95%AA%E5%95%A6%E5%A4%A7%E7%88%86%E7%82%B8.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d9/sco4ohhuybtkwqc74wy1fwrjn2cuile.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%99%BC%E9%87%8C%E5%95%AA%E5%95%A6%E5%A4%A7%E7%88%86%E7%82%B8.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d9/sco4ohhuybtkwqc74wy1fwrjn2cuile.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />噼里啪啦大爆炸+\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（魔法伤害）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协同号令\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">协同号令</font></span></span>]，选择地形格，对目标范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有敌人造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">150%</font>伤害，并施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"整蛊彩蛋\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">整蛊彩蛋</font></span></span>]（持续2回合），之后准备<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合，再对区域内敌人造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">75%</font>伤害；准备期间，处于准备区域中的敌人受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼移动2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼移动2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"易伤2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">易伤2</font></span></span>]。攻击前，攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-3 3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/88/gna3oc2cjl54ui7uiti4hvjxnhrilam.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/88/gna3oc2cjl54ui7uiti4hvjxnhrilam.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%B4%9D%E6%8B%89%E2%80%A2%E9%AD%94%E6%9C%AF%E5%B8%88\" title=\"角色图鉴库/贝拉•魔术师\"><img alt=\"头像 贝拉•魔术师.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7e/a0hndp63mq5sil1xz7x6f9ro1txplpl.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">贝拉•魔术师</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-ali